  "title": "fix round 2 (gate): S3e promotion framework, hermes-eval suite and success metrics: features cache_aware_conte",
  "spec": "Fix round 2 for T-1325 (gate red). Scope widened by orchestrator/spawn.py, tests/test_spawn.py, tests/test_pool.py. Failures:\ntests-green: FAILED. Failures only:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n    raise RuntimeError(\"boom\")\nRuntimeError: boom\nFAIL: test_cache_mode_keys_in_tool_disclosure_and_skills (test_pool.DisclosureCacheConfig.test_cache_mode_keys_in_tool_disclosure_and_skills)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\nAssertionError: 'shadow' != 'active'\nFAIL: test_cache_mode_validated_once_without_mutating_config (test_spawn.ContextTelemetry.test_cache_mode_validated_once_without_mutating_config)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\nAssertionError: 'shadow' != 'active'\nFAIL: test_active_tool_cache_mode_puts_stable_catalog_before_schemas_only_in_active (test_spawn.DisclosureCachePresentation.test_active_tool_cache_mode_puts_stable_catalog_before_schemas_only_in_active)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\nAssertionError: False != True\nFAIL: test_skill_catalog_block_only_in_active_cache_mode_and_chars_recorded (test_spawn.DisclosureCachePresentation.test_skill_catalog_block_only_in_active_cache_mode_and_chars_recorded)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\nAssertionError: False != True\nFAILED (failures=4)\n/Users/k3ntaw/code/orchestrator/wt/T-1325/.orchestrator/runs/tests/T-1325-20260923-191728.log\n\nfix round 2 rule: Design decision (Planner): context_router.cache_mode(cfg, section) goes back to a pure accessor that returns the validated configured value (existing tests in tests/test_pool.py and tests/test_spawn.py pass unchanged). The promotion gate lives in a new context_router.effective_cache_mode(cfg, section, *, root, now=None, remembered=None) -> (mode, refused_reason): it calls cache_mode, and only when the configured value is active it calls promotion.evaluate(feature, promotion.collect(feature, root), cfg, root=root, now=now) and returns shadow with the stay reason; it is called once per packet build at the three entry points in spawn.py (context, tools, skills) with root=STATE, never from the accessor; the decision rows record configured_cache_mode, effective cache_mode and refused_reason so a refused active is visible in the log and scorecard; notify fires only when the refusal reasons change (kept on the pool object like steering) and is wrapped so a failure never breaks spawning; an unknown section raises ValueError, never KeyError. Move the acceptance test test_cache_mode_active_refuses_to_shadow_when_promotion_stays onto effective_cache_mode. Docs 19 gain a revert note: git revert of this task's commits restores ungated active.\nRun .claude/hooks/tests-green.sh . until it exits 0; do not ask questions; report files changed and failures-only output.",
  "inputs": [],
  "acceptance": [
    "tests/test_promotion.py::test_hermes_features_registered_with_sample_quality_economics_and_eval_criteria",
